      <groundspeak:encoded_hints>CAP 2 CM BGL 21&#39; WEST OF FENCE

ASC CAP 2 CM BGL,21&#39; West. OF THE West. FENCE AT 8604 - 180 STREET; 3.5&#39; North. OF THE South. FENCE AT 8604

